OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear skies
OL,6,Fat first. Cloud will thicken tonight
OL,7,Fwith outbreaks of light rain moving in
OL,8,Fafter midnight. Staying mild under the
OL,9,Fblanket of cloud with a gentle breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FLargely cloudy at first,
OL,12,Falthough some brighter spells are
OL,13,Flikely during the afternoon. A few
OL,14,Fspots of light rain are possible where
OL,15,Fthe cloud thickens.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
